## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/networks_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.title=Networks
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.bullet0=A network is a group of devices that share energy, gas, or fluid.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.bullet1=Devices join a network by touching each other, or by being linked with conduits.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.bullet2=A device can belong to several networks at the same time.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.bullet3=Generators fill a network and consumers draw from it. Most devices are both.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networks.bullet4=See Also: Conduits, Generators, Consumers, Network Monitor

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:energy_conduit, fluffyalien_energistics:fluid_conduit, fluffyalien_energistics:gas_conduit, fluffyalien_energistics:multi_conduit
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/networks_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.title=Conduits
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.bullet0=Conduits link devices into a network without placing them side by side.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.bullet1=Each conduit carries one thing: energy, fluid, or gas.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.bullet2=Interact with a placed conduit while holding another to merge them, so a single block carries both.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.conduits.bullet3=See Also: Networks

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/generic_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.title=Generators
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet0=A generator is a device that produces energy, gas, or fluid.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet1=Whatever it makes goes to the consumers holding the least, so one device cannot drain everything.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet2=Every generator keeps a reserve of up to 6,400u, and spends the reserve first. One running at full efficiency has none left over.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet3=Hover over the reserve (or tap on mobile) to see how much it makes per game tick.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet4=A device can generate and consume at the same time.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.generators.bullet5=See Also: Networks, Consumers

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/generic_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.title=Consumers
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.bullet0=A consumer is a device that uses energy, gas, or fluid.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.bullet1=Every consumer holds up to 6,400u of each thing it uses.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.bullet2=Hover over the storage (or tap on mobile) to see how much it uses per game tick.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.bullet3=A device can consume and generate at the same time.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.consumers.bullet4=See Also: Networks, Generators, Battery, Fluid Tank, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:ammonia_factory
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/ammonia_factory_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.title=Ammonia Factory
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.bullet0=Combines 1 nitrogen and 3 hydrogen into 2 ammonia, using 20 energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.bullet1=Makes 4 ammonia per second, consuming 2 nitrogen, 6 hydrogen, and 40 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.bullet2=Counting the gas it eats, each ammonia costs 50 energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaFactory.bullet3=See Also: Atmospheric Condenser, Fluid Separator, Ammonia Generator, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:ammonia_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/ammonia_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.title=Ammonia Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.bullet0=Burns 2 ammonia into 250 energy, or 125 energy per unit.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.bullet1=Burns 4 ammonia per second, making 500 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.ammoniaGenerator.bullet2=See Also: Ammonia Factory, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:atmospheric_condenser
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/atmospheric_condenser_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.title=Atmospheric Condenser
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.bullet0=Pulls 4 gas per second out of the air. Which gas depends on where it is: nitrogen in the overworld, carbon in the nether, hydrogen in the end.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.bullet1=Consumes 20 energy per unit, or 80 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.atmosphericCondenser.bullet2=See Also: Ammonia Factory, Basic Refinery, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:basic_refinery
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/basic_refinery_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.title=Basic Refinery
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.bullet0=Turns fluids and gases into items. Choose which with the options button.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.bullet1=Coal: 100 carbon and 96 energy, over 8s.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.bullet2=Plastic: 100 oil, 1 coal, and 192 energy, over 16s. Plastic unlocks the last tier of recipes.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.basicRefinery.bullet3=See Also: Atmospheric Condenser, Oil Extractor, Fluid Tank, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:battery
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/battery_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.title=Battery
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.bullet0=Stores up to 9,600 energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.bullet1=Gives a network somewhere to put excess energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.battery.bullet2=See Also: Networks, Fluid Tank, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:block_breaker
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/block_breaker_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.title=Block Breaker
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.bullet0=Breaks the block in front of it, which drops as an item.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.bullet1=Breaks 2 blocks per second, at 10 energy each.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.bullet2=Air and liquids are skipped and cost nothing.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockBreaker.bullet3=See Also: Block Placer

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:block_placer
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/block_placer_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.title=Block Placer
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.bullet0=Places a block from its inventory in front of it, but only where there is air.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.bullet1=Places 2 blocks per second, at 10 energy each.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.bullet2=Hoppers can insert blocks.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.blockPlacer.bullet3=See Also: Block Breaker

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:centrifuge
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/centrifuge_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.title=Centrifuge
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.bullet0=Spins dirt, gravel, sand, or soul sand apart. Each item gives four results at once.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.bullet1=Dirt gives seeds and saplings. Gravel and sand can give diamonds. Soul sand gives blaze powder, nether wart, ghast tears, and quartz.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.bullet2=Takes 16s and 768 energy per item.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.bullet3=Hoppers can insert and extract. It stops while its output slots are full.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.centrifuge.bullet4=See Also: Crusher, Organic Generator

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:coal_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/coal_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.title=Coal Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.bullet0=Burns one coal into 800 energy, over 25s.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.bullet1=Takes coal only, not charcoal or any other fuel.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.bullet2=Hoppers can insert coal.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.coalGenerator.bullet3=See Also: Basic Refinery, Void Miner

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:crucible
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/crucible_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.title=Crucible
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.bullet0=Melts one cobblestone into 32 lava, over 16s.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.bullet1=Consumes 64 energy per cobblestone.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.bullet2=Hoppers can insert cobblestone.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crucible.bullet3=See Also: Lava Generator, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:crusher
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/crusher_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.title=Crusher
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.bullet0=Crushes stone into cobblestone, cobblestone into gravel, and gravel into sand.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.bullet1=Takes 5s and 80 energy per item.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.bullet2=Hoppers can insert and extract items.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.crusher.bullet3=See Also: Centrifuge

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:disposal_unit
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/disposal_unit_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.title=Disposal Unit
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.bullet0=Destroys any fluid or gas sent to it.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.bullet1=Costs 1 energy for every 2 units destroyed.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.disposalUnit.bullet2=See Also: Fluid Separator, Fluid Tank, Gas Canister

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:fluid_separator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_separator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.title=Fluid Separator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.bullet0=Splits a fluid into the gases it is made of. Every 6 water gives 4 hydrogen and 2 oxygen. Every 6 oil gives 4 hydrogen and 2 carbon.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.bullet1=Splits 12 fluid per second, consuming 80 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.bullet2=It takes the first fluid it receives and separates only that from then on.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.bullet3=Both outputs must have somewhere to go or it stops.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidSeparator.bullet4=See Also: Disposal Unit, Gas Canister, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:fluid_tank
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/fluid_tank_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.title=Fluid Tank
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.bullet0=Stores up to 9,600 of one fluid: water, lava, or oil.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.bullet1=Holds one type at a time. Set it with the options button, or let it take the first type it receives.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.bullet2=Interact with a bucket to move 100 in or out by hand.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.fluidTank.bullet3=See Also: Gas Canister, Battery

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:gas_canister
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/gas_canister_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.title=Gas Canister
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.bullet0=Stores up to 9,600 of one gas: ammonia, carbon, hydrogen, nitrogen, or oxygen.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.bullet1=Holds one type at a time. Set it with the options button, or let it take the first type it receives.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.gasCanister.bullet2=See Also: Fluid Tank, Battery

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:item_charger
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/item_charger_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.title=Item Charger
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.bullet0=Charges any item that stores energy, including items from other add-ons.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.bullet1=Moves up to 80 energy per second into the item.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.itemCharger.bullet2=See Also: Consumers

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:lava_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/lava_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.title=Lava Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.bullet0=Burns lava into energy, at 5 energy per unit.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.bullet1=Burns 8 lava per second, making 40 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.lavaGenerator.bullet2=See Also: Pump, Crucible, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:network_monitor
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/network_monitor_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.title=Network Monitor
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.bullet0=Interact with it to open a readout of every network it is on, grouped by energy, gas, and fluid.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.bullet1=Each network reports how much per second moved from one device to another, and how much no device took, which stays in reserves.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.bullet2=The figures are averaged over the last several seconds, and keep updating while the readout is open.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.bullet3=A network only appears while something is flowing on it.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.networkMonitor.bullet4=See Also: Networks

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:oil_extractor
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/oil_extractor_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.title=Oil Extractor
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.bullet0=Makes 8 oil per second out of nothing, anywhere. It needs no particular block beneath it.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.bullet1=Consumes 5 energy per unit, or 40 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilExtractor.bullet2=See Also: Oil Generator, Basic Refinery, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:oil_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/oil_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.title=Oil Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.bullet0=Burns oil into energy, at 10 energy per unit.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.bullet1=Burns 8 oil per second, making 80 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.oilGenerator.bullet2=See Also: Oil Extractor, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:organic_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/organic_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.title=Organic Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.bullet0=Burns seeds and saplings into energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.bullet1=A seed burns for 13s and gives 260 energy. A sapling burns for 19s and gives 380 energy.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.bullet2=Hoppers can insert fuel.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.organicGenerator.bullet3=See Also: Centrifuge

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:solar_panel
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/solar_panel_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.title=Solar Panel
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.bullet0=Generates 10 energy per second during the day.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.bullet1=Only works in the overworld.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.bullet2=Needs open sky. Anything above it stops it, including water and other fluids.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.solarPanel.bullet3=See Also: Generators, Battery

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:powered_furnace
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/powered_furnace_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.title=Powered Furnace
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.bullet0=Smelts items, 5s each. Only knows vanilla smelting recipes.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.bullet1=Costs 50 energy per item.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.bullet2=Hoppers can insert and extract items.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.poweredFurnace.bullet3=See Also: Crusher, Centrifuge

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:pump
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/pump_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.title=Pump
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.bullet0=Makes 8 water or lava per second, depending on which is directly below it. It never drains the source.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.bullet1=Consumes 6 energy per unit, or 48 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.bullet2=Change the block below it and it switches over on its own.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.pump.bullet3=See Also: Water Generator, Lava Generator, Fluid Tank

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:tesseract
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/tesseract_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.title=Tesseract
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.bullet0=Joins its network to every other tesseract sharing the same name, and passes energy, gas, and fluid between them.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.bullet1=Distance does not matter, and neither do dimensions.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.bullet2=Set the name with the options button. One with no name connects to nothing.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.bullet3=Uses 0 energy, and has no limit on how much it moves.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.tesseract.bullet4=See Also: Networks, Conduits

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:void_miner
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/void_miner_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.title=Void Miner
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.bullet0=Mines ore out of nothing: coal, raw iron, raw gold, amethyst, emerald, and diamond.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.bullet1=Takes 16s and 800 energy per item, whatever it turns up.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.bullet2=Out of every 18 results, on average: 6 coal, 4 raw iron, 4 raw gold, 2 amethyst, 1 emerald, and 1 diamond.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.bullet3=It stops as soon as something is sitting in its output slot.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.voidMiner.bullet4=See Also: Centrifuge, Coal Generator

## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.targets=fluffyalien_energistics:water_generator
## fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.icon=textures/fluffyalien/energistics/ui/tutorial_book/water_generator_icon
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.title=Water Generator
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.bullet0=Burns water into energy, at 3 energy per unit.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.bullet1=Burns 8 water per second, making 24 energy per second.
fluffyalien_energistics.ui.tutorialBook.entry.waterGenerator.bullet2=See Also: Pump, Fluid Separator, Fluid Tank
